 overflow...\n\nReasons to become our favourite plumber:\n\n- You'll be provided with many, many, many Pipes!\n- You'll meet lots of nice ducks, see stunning waterfalls...\n- Puffy clouds will guide you along the way!\n- Positional sounds & music (9 different soundtracks) will relax and alert you when it's time to move!\n- Day, Night and Autumn worlds, for a grand total of 54 challenging levels (and more to come!): hours of challenging gameplay!\n- 2 Game modes : classic, challenge.\n- Challenge your friends with Achievements and Leaderboards!\n- Learn how to plumb and profit in real life!", "short_description": "Use your plumber powers to place pipes, join the vases and make the water flow!\nHelp little ducks to have fun surfing a water jet! You don't want to sadden a duck...\nBeware, make it in time, or the water will overflow..."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://quackthepipes.com/privacy-policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Zgkaos", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://quackthepipes.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "377978390272490"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["PUZZLE"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "318806346961318"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 3, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "943068143698539"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "841480430354614"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1442973642852313"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "943068143